      "recursion": "For each pi in {candidate, reference} separately, decisions t=0..T-1: V^pi_T=0; V^pi_t = vhat^pi(H_t) + rho^pi_t*(r_t + V^pi_{t+1} - qhat^pi(H_t,a_t)); vhat^pi(H_t)=sum_a pi(a|H_t)*qhat^pi(H_t,a); rho^pi_t = pi(a_t|H_t)/pi_b(a_t|H_t) over pitch types; r_t nonzero only at PA end = W(S_PA_end)",
