      "v3_misspecification_report": {
        "what": "|delta_gap_V3| for V3 tempered alpha=0.5 (law tempered_alpha_0.5), max over seeds.planning_v2, printed beside the 2026 result",
        "flag_if_exceeds_MEI": "pi_b_misspecification_sensitivity_exceeds_MEI",
        "decision_input": false,
        "registered_mandatory_report": true
      },
      "rationale": "V2 logs are generated by pi_b_hat itself, so V2 cannot exercise pi_b_hat misspecification; the candidate DR is single-robust (q_hat = Q_ref, COOP-019 F5), so its bias rides on pi_b_hat. Claiming improvement beyond MEI therefore requires clearing MEI + the V2-measured bias bound, with V3 (logging law != pi_b_hat) disclosed as misspecification sensitivity.",
